RF08 Replacement
<UL>
<LI><b>8x11</b> is an old version of all the boards for the RF08 replacement, 
panelized on an 8"x11" sheet.</LI>
<LI><b>RF08old</b> is an old version of the controller part of the RF08
replacement.</LI>
<LI><b>lights</b> is the debug display for the RF08 replacement.</LI>
<LI><b>drives</b> contains the "drives" for the RF08 replacement.</LI>
<LI><b>drivessop</b> contains a variation of drives that allows for the
cheaper SMT versions of the SRAM chip.</LI>
<LI><b>RF08b</b> is the latest version of the controller for the RF08 
replacement.</LI>
<LI><b>RF08bOmnibus</b> is an start on an Omnibus version.</LI>
